<title>UK: Ford Motor Credit sets NZ$100 mln 3-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Ford Motor Credit sets NZ$100 mln 3-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FORD MOTOR CREDIT CO</p>
<p> AMT    NZ$100 MLN    COUPON     7.50 PCT  MATURITY    22.SEP.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.610   PAY DATE    22.SEP.97</p>
<p>FULL FEES  1.50  </p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NZ</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.5	 SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
